# Shivansi Restaurant & Sweet Shop — Project Context

## Quick Overview
A full-stack QR-code restaurant ordering system built with:
- **Framework**: TanStack Start (React + Vite SSR), TypeScript
- **Database**: PostgreSQL (via Prisma)
- **Backend API**: Fastify (Node.js) + TypeScript
- **State Management**: Redux Toolkit (Cart & Theme state)
- **Styling**: Vanilla CSS (custom design system in `src/styles.css` with ui-ux-pro-max bases)
- **Package manager**: npm/bun
- **Deployment target**: Vercel (Frontend) / Render/VPS (Backend)

---

## Architecture

### Directory layout
```
src/
  routes/               # TanStack file-based router (SSR-aware)
    __root.tsx          # Root layout: SEO head, CartProvider, AuthSync, aurora-bg
    index.tsx           # Customer home page (hero, offers, specials, popular, menu)
    menu.tsx            # Full menu route (delegates to MenuExplorer)
    cart.tsx            # Cart + checkout page → calls placeOrder server fn
    order.$orderId.tsx  # Live order tracking (Realtime sub + 15 s poll)
    my-orders.tsx       # Customer order history (phone OTP verification)
    settings.tsx        # UI Theme (Light/Dark) and Base selection (Pro Max)
    table.$tableNumber.tsx  # QR landing: sets table cookie and redirects to /
    auth.tsx            # Owner login: email+password + TOTP MFA (with ?redir= support)
    admin.tsx           # Admin layout: auth guard, nav, real-time order sound/notification
    admin/index.tsx     # Live kitchen board (KPI cards + order status management)
    admin/menu.tsx      # Category + product CRUD (dialogs, availability toggle)
    admin/inventory.tsx # Inventory CRUD (stock quantities, low-stock alert)
    admin/offers.tsx    # Offers & loyalty rules management
    admin/tables.tsx    # Table management + printable QR codes
    admin/customers.tsx # Read-only customer list with visit/spend data
    admin/reports.tsx   # Revenue KPIs (today / 7d / 30d) + top-sellers table
    admin/settings.tsx  # Restaurant settings + owner email + WhatsApp bot config

  components/
    site-header.tsx     # Sticky glassmorphism nav with cart badge
    site-footer.tsx     # Footer with contact, hours, links
    product-card.tsx    # 3D glass card: image, badges, weight selector, add-to-cart
    menu-explorer.tsx   # Search + category filter + product grid
    invoice.tsx         # Printable invoice component
    cookie-consent.tsx  # GDPR cookie banner

  lib/
    cart.tsx            # Redux Cart Hook (dispatches to cartSlice)
    db.ts               # All public TanStack Query queryOptions (Supabase client)
    types.ts            # TypeScript interfaces + ORDER_FLOW, PAYMENT_METHODS constants
    auth.ts             # useSession, useIsAdmin (MFA AAL2 check)
    orders.functions.ts # Server fns: placeOrder, getPublicOrder, getOrdersByPhone,
                        #              requestOrderHistoryCode
    notify.functions.ts # Server fn: updateOrderStatus (with WhatsApp bot update)
    config.functions.ts # Server fns: getOwnerSettings, saveOwnerSettings,
                        #              getAppConfig, saveAppConfig
    whatsapp.server.ts  # WhatsApp Cloud API sender (reads creds from app_config or env)
    images.ts           # HERO_IMAGE, productImage, fallbackImage helpers
    format.ts           # money, effectivePrice, weightPrice, formatTime, isToday
    cookies.ts          # Lightweight cookie read/write/delete helpers
    error-capture.ts    # Centralised error capture utility
    error-page.ts       # Shared error page helper
    utils.ts            # cn() (clsx + twMerge)
    admin.ts            # useSaveRow / useDeleteRow mutation hooks (Supabase CRUD)

  integrations/supabase/
    client.ts           # Public Supabase client (browser-safe keys)
    client.server.ts    # supabaseAdmin with service-role key (server only)
    auth-middleware.ts  # TanStack Start middleware: requireSupabaseAuth

  store/
    index.ts            # Redux configureStore
    slices/
      cartSlice.ts      # Cart state + table number tracking
      themeSlice.ts     # Theme mode (light/dark/auto) and UI base style

  server.ts / start.ts  # Nitro/Vinxi SSR entry points

public/
  robots.txt
  sitemap.xml
  llms.txt
  favicon.ico           # No og-image.jpg yet (referenced in meta but missing)
```

