## Prisma Schema (PostgreSQL)

### Tables
| Table | Key columns |
|---|---|
| `restaurant_settings` | name, tagline, logo_url, banner_url, address, phone, gst_number, opening_time, closing_time, upi_id, tax_percent, packing_charge, delivery_charge, currency, theme |
| `categories` | name, slug, description, image_url, sort_order, is_active |
| `products` | category_id, name, description, image_url, price, offer_price, rating, review_count, prep_time_mins, is_available, is_veg, is_spicy, calories, is_special, is_popular, is_recommended, sold_by_weight, price_per_kg, sort_order |
| `orders` | order_number, table_number, customer_id, customer_name, customer_phone, status, payment_method, payment_status, subtotal, discount, discount_label, tax, packing_charge, delivery_charge, total, notes, session_token |
| `order_items` | order_id, product_id, name, unit_price, quantity, weight_label, instructions, line_total |
| `customers` | user_id, name, phone, birthday, visits, reward_points, total_spend, favourite_item, saved_address, last_visit |
| `offers` | title, description, banner_url, discount_percent, coupon_code, category_ids, product_ids, starts_at, ends_at, is_active |
| `discounts` | name, type(flat/percent), value, coupon_code, min_order_amount, max_discount, starts_at, ends_at, start_hour, end_hour, category_ids, product_ids, is_active, usage_count |
| `loyalty_rules` | visits_required, discount_percent, reward_points, expiry_days, is_active |
| `inventory_items` | name, unit, quantity, low_stock_threshold, cost_per_unit, expiry_date |
| `restaurant_tables` | table_number, seats, is_active |
| `reviews` | product_id, customer_name, rating, comment, is_published |
| `notifications` | type, title, body, is_read |
| `user_roles` | user_id, role (enum: admin) |
| `app_config` | owner_email, whatsapp_token, whatsapp_phone_number_id |
| `phone_verifications` | phone, code_hash, expires_at, used, attempts |

### Auth
- Owner login: Supabase Auth (email + password) + mandatory TOTP MFA (AAL2)
- Admin guard: `user_roles` table row-level check + `aal` claim check
- Customer: guest by default; phone identified via order; OTP verification for order history
- Realtime: `admin-orders` channel for live kitchen board; `order-{id}` channel for customer tracking

