## Environment Variables Required

### Backend (`backend/.env`)
```
DATABASE_URL=postgres://...
JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=...
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=...
PORT=4000
```

### Frontend (`frontend/.env`)
```
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1
```

