## Design System Notes
- **Palette**: Deep purple dark `oklch(0.12 0.012 285)` base with gold/amber accent
- **Fonts**: Playfair Display SC (display headings) + Karla (body)
- **Utility classes**: `glass`, `glass-strong`, `card-3d`, `hover-lift`, `animate-rise`, `animate-float`, `aurora-bg`, `gradient-text`, `gradient-text-gold`, `pulse-ring`, `scroll-reveal`, `stagger-children` — all defined in `src/styles.css`
- **Variants**: Badge variants: `glass`, `gold`, `veg`, `nonveg`, `warning`, `destructive`
- **Button variants**: `hero` (gradient primary), `glass`, `ghost`, `destructive`
